tag": "column", "width": "60px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<text_tag color='turquoise'>体验优化</text_tag>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "**学校名称识别**：支持缩写检索，清洗了对不上的学校数据"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "44px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>11-13</font>", "text_size": "notation", "text_align": "right"}]}]}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "none", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "60px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<text_tag color='neutral'>Bug 修复</text_tag>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "录单课时输入 20h 被改成 19.95h"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "44px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>11-13</font>", "text_size": "notation", "text_align": "right"}]}]}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "none", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "60px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<text_tag color='neutral'>Bug 修复</text_tag>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "必填项填完仍无法提交或暂存"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "44px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>11-13</font>", "text_size": "notation", "text_align": "right"}]}]}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "none", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "60px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<text_tag color='neutral'>Bug 修复</text_tag>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "企微直接收款的订单上传后无法确认录单"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "44px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>11-13</font>", "text_size": "notation", "text_align": "right"}]}]}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "none", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "60px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<text_tag color='neutral'>Bug 修复</text_tag>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "领取线索后年级、学校反写错误（研究生显示成 9 年级）"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "44px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>11-13</font>", "text_size": "notation", "text_align": "right"}]}]}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "none", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "60px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<text_tag color='neutral'>Bug 修复</text_tag>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "学员年级显示成数字（中台移动办公）"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "44px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>11-17</font>", "text_size": "notation", "text_align": "right"}]}]}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "none", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "60px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<text_tag color='neutral'>Bug 修复</text_tag>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "录单金额输入 7800 被改成 7799.99"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "44px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>11-18</font>", "text_size": "notation", "text_align": "right"}]}]}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "none", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "60px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<text_tag color='neutral'>Bug 修复</text_tag>"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "试听时长填 1H 被改成 0.5H（待反馈人确认）"}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "44px", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>11-18</font>", "text_size": "notation", "text_align": "right"}]}]}, {"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>使用数据：11-13 当日侧边栏录单 18 笔（环比 +200%）、正式提需 10 条（+150%）。</font>", "text_size": "notation", "margin": "4px 0px 0px 0px"}]}, {"tag": "markdown", "content": "**接下来** <font color='grey'>本周 6 项 · 下周 6 项</font>", "margin": "0px 0px 8px 0px"}, {"tag": "column_set", "flex_mode": "stretch", "horizontal_spacing": "8px", "margin": "0px 0px 12px 0px", "columns": [{"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "elements": [{"tag": "interactive_container", "width": "fill", "background_style": "turquoise-50", "corner_radius": "8px", "padding": "12px 12px 12px 12px", "vertical_spacing": "4px", "margin": "0px", "horizontal_align": "left", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "**<font color='turquoise'>本周</font>**"}, {"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>今日待办、学员画像</font>", "text_size": "notation"}, {"tag": "markdown", "content": "1. **今日待办正式上线**：自动提取会话待办，可跳转客户、标记完成\n2. **今日待办展示优化**：待办较多时按学员聚合\n3. **今日待办跳转优化**：解决点击后回到首个页签的问题\n4. **学员画像上线**：确定侧边栏展示位置和结构后发布\n5. **手动绑定线索**：完成验证后通知销售使用\n6. **复制老师信息、教务信息**：完成验证后通知销售使用"}]}]}, {"tag": "column", "width": "weighted", "weight": 1, "elements": [{"tag": "interactive_container", "width": "fill", "background_style": "yellow-50", "corner_radius": "8px", "padding": "12px 12px 12px 12px", "vertical_spacing": "4px", "margin": "0px", "horizontal_align": "left", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "**<font color='orange'>下周</font>**"}, {"tag": "markdown", "content": "<font color='grey'>用户路径、班主任</font>", "text_size": "notation"}, {"tag": "markdown", "content": "1. **用户路径模块**：中台路径完整打通，信息和文件内容可视化流转\n2. **试听品控报告**：生成后飞书提醒，侧边栏展示报告和销转建议\n3. **学员交接信息共享**：试听反馈、上课记录随学员同步给接手班主任\n4. **向班主任团队开放侧边栏**：按角色配置工作台，开放时间待确认\n5. **排课改为选择式操作**：分排课、改期、取消，支持时区自动换算\n6. **匹配老师结果展示优化**：方便查看和确认"}]}]}]}, {"tag": "markdown", "content": "**待排期** <font color='grey'>4 项 · 时间待定</font>", "margin": "0px 0px 8px 0px"}, {"tag": "interactive_container", "width": "fill", "background_style": "grey-50", "corner_radius": "8px", "padding": "12px 12px 12px 12px", "vertical_spacing": "4px", "margin": "0px 0px 12px 0px", "horizontal_align": "left", "elements": [{"tag": "markdown", "content": "1. **编辑学员信息**：侧边栏可修改学员姓名等信息，AI 提取为主、人工修改为辅\n2. **提需 AI 自动分析**：全员默认开启，提需时自动提取会话关键信息生成辅导需求\n3. **发起收款自动录单**：企微发起收款并支付成功后自动识别录单，不用再传截图\n4. **切换会话保留填写进度**：提需、录单填到一半切换聊天，回来后内容不丢失"}]}, {"tag": "button", "text": {"tag": "plain_text", "content": "查看完整功能排期"}, "type": "primary_filled", "width": "fill", "behaviors": [{"type": "open_url", "default_url": "https://vm94j8bzy7.feishu.cn/base/XTPpbsyWza4rixsRuCwcALI8nOh?table=tblsfV4mKschNic4&view=vewsr4pDuD"}]}]}}